eeting\nAbsentee Review Meeting\nView All Events\n/Calendar.aspx\nLatest News & Spotlights\nStay up to date with your county\nBoard of Elections Special Meeting Notice \u2013 October 2026\nThe New Hanover County Board of Elections will hold its special meeting on Tuesday, October 20, 2026, at 5:00 p.m. in the Board Room at the Board of Elections Office, located at 226 Government Center Drive, Wilmington, NC 28403.\nRead on...\nBoard of Elections Special Meeting Notice \u2013 October 2026\nThe New Hanover County Board of Elections will hold its special meeting on Tuesday, October 13, 2026, at 5:00 p.m. in the Board Room at the Board of Elections Office, located at 226 Government Center Drive, Wilmington, NC 28403.\nRead on...\nBoard of Elections Special Meeting Notice \u2013 October 2026\nThe New Hanover County Board of Elections will hold its special meeting on Tuesday, October 6, 2026, at 5:00 p.m. in the Board Room at the Board of Elections Office, located at 226 Government Center Drive, Wilmington, NC 28403.\nRead on...\nView All News\n/CivicAlerts.aspx\nFacebook\nX\nFacebook\nX\nTweets by nhcvote\nContact Us\nCounty Board of Elections\n226 Government Center Drive\nWilmington, NC 28403\nPhone:\n910-798-7330\nMunicipalities\nCarolina Beach\nCity of Wilmington\nKure Beach\nWrightsville Beach\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nNHC Home Page\nEmployee Portal\nSite Map\nContact NHC\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\nPrivacy Policy\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by\nCivicPlus\u00ae\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nArrow Left\nArrow Right\n[]\nSlideshow Left Arrow\nSlideshow Right Arrow",
